# Test file for Visual Studio (open it and click "Send request" above each request).
# 1) Change the port to yours (see the URL in the browser when you press F5)
@host = https://localhost:7296

### 1) Login as the seeded admin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@market.local", "password": "password-admin" }

### 2) Paste the accessToken from the response here:
@token = 

### Public: list products
GET {{host}}/api/products

### Admin: create a category
POST {{host}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Snacks", "description": "Chips, nuts, chocolate" }

### Admin: create a product (use a real categoryId)
POST {{host}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Chocolate Bar", "price": 1.5, "stockQuantity": 50, "categoryId": 1 }

### Admin: list users
GET {{host}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Register a normal customer
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Ali Test", "email": "ali@test.com", "password": "Test@12345" }

### Customer: add to cart (login as ali first and paste HIS token in @token)
POST {{host}}/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 }

### Customer: view cart
GET {{host}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Customer trying an admin endpoint -> should return 403
GET {{host}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{$bearerToken}}

### Login as a normal user (جواب رو ببین و refreshToken رو کپی کن)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ali@test.com", "password": "Test@12345" }

### Refresh token رو اینجا بذار (بعد از هر درخواست مقدار جدید رو جایگزین کن)
@refreshToken =

### Refresh
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}" }

### Logout
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}" }
